dnd-kit fork for OpenTierBoy
============================

This folder holds a copy of the dnd-kit drag and drop packages, used by OpenTierBoy.

Source repository: https://github.com/clauderic/dnd-kit
Tag:               @dnd-kit/react@0.5.1 (the tags @dnd-kit/<name>@0.5.1 of the other packages
                   point at the same commit)
Commit:            01bc678e93477e56a78aa2244c69b08a96cb0da6 (2026-10-15)
npm release:       0.5.1, published 2026-10-15

Packages copied from that commit (folder packages/<name> upstream):

  @dnd-kit/abstract    abstract/
  @dnd-kit/collision   collision/
  @dnd-kit/dom         dom/
  @dnd-kit/geometry    geometry/
  @dnd-kit/helpers     helpers/
  @dnd-kit/react       react/
  @dnd-kit/state       state/

Also copied: the shared TypeScript settings (config/typescript/base.json, vanilla.json,
react.json) and the repository LICENSE.

Licence: MIT. Copyright (c) 2021, Claudéric Demers. See LICENSE here and in every package
folder. The licence must stay with the code.

Changes made for OpenTierBoy are listed in docs/dnd-fork.md (section "Local changes") in
the OpenTierBoy repository, together with how to update from upstream.
